{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06770","headline":"洛阳尉刘晏与府掾诸公茶集天宫寺岸道上人房 · 王昌龄","name":"洛阳尉刘晏与府掾诸公茶集天宫寺岸道上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良友呼我宿，月明悬天宫。\n道安风尘外，洒扫青林中。\n削去府县理，豁然神机空。\n自从三湘还，始得今夕同。\n旧居太行北，远宦沧溟东。\n各有四方事，白云处处通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}